00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:25.210
and we sang the Fuller House theme song,

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.475
cause everyone knows it,
and that was really fun.

00:03:28.475 --> 00:03:29.800
- I would have totally sang along.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.172
