00:04:22.958 --> 00:04:24.118
(audience laughs)

00:04:24.118 --> 00:04:25.850
Now, for those of you that don't know...

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:27.150
- [Kelly] What is that bowling alley?

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.150
- [Candice] Lucky strike.

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:29.929
- [Kelly] Yeah lucky strike,

00:04:29.929 --> 00:04:31.395
that's what we were gonna say yeah.

00:04:31.395 --> 00:04:32.939
- And Hollywood and Highland
is like times square.

00:04:32.939 --> 00:04:34.730
So my karaoke version of Baby Got Back,

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.290
