this is my second year

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.170
working with the Salvation Army.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:37.530
And so many of us, we
see those red kettles

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:39.499
out in front of the stores
and we here the bells ringing,

00:05:39.499 --> 00:05:42.724
but a lot of people don't
realize where the money goes.

00:05:42.724 --> 00:05:45.670
So, anytime you donate to the red kettle,

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.930
it stays right in your community.

00:05:47.930 --> 00:05:50.930
And The Salvation Army
provides not only basic needs,

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:54.690
like shelter, and a warm
meal, and Christmas presents

00:05:54.690 --> 00:05:56.340
for kids on Christmas morning,

00:05:56.340 --> 00:06:00.140
but they have things all over the country.

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:02.815
They serve over 23 million people a year,

00:06:02.815 --> 00:06:07.413
through rehabilitation programs,
and job training centers,

00:06:07.413 --> 00:06:10.265
daycare, they really help
people get back on their feet,

00:06:10.265 --> 00:06:14.160
and just push through the
circumstances that their in,

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.871
to be able to just get up and
get out, and live their lives.

00:06:18.871 --> 00:06:19.826
- [Kelly] They're helping.

00:06:19.826 --> 00:06:21.837
- So, just want to remind everyone,

00:06:21.837 --> 00:06:24.960
it's the giving season,
to remember to donate.

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:26.740
There's no amount that's
too small to donate

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:27.860
to the red kettle.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.370
Or go to the website, you
can even set up a reoccurring

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.710
monthly gift if you want.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.281
- My mother does that, she's so good.

00:06:33.281 --> 00:06:36.120
She saves all the animals, all the family.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.110
She's always saving people.

00:06:37.110 --> 00:06:38.430
I'm like you're such a good human.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.714
- It's such a great thing to do.

00:06:39.714 --> 00:06:40.547
Also to donate in someones name,

00:06:40.547 --> 00:06:42.260
for that person who has everything,

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:43.874
make a donation as a gift.

00:06:43.874 --> 00:06:47.070
